    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly to Death!</strong> is a thrilling free-to-play arcade game where every second counts!<br>Soar through deadly obstacles in two intense modes: complete hand-crafted levels or go for the highest score in endless mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tons of <strong>unique characters</strong> and <strong>customize them</strong> with fun accessories. Want more? Use the built-in <strong>Level Creator</strong> to design your own challenges and <strong>publish them online</strong> for the world to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Simple to play, hard to master.<br>\ud83c\udfae Fast-paced action.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Customize &amp; create.<br>\ud83c\udf0d Compete, share, and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to fly... or die?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly to Death!</strong> is a thrilling free-to-play arcade game where every second counts!<br>Soar through deadly obstacles in two intense modes: complete hand-crafted levels or go for the highest score in endless mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tons of <strong>unique characters</strong> and <strong>customize them</strong> with fun accessories. Want more? Use the built-in <strong>Level Creator</strong> to design your own challenges and <strong>publish them online</strong> for the world to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Simple to play, hard to master.<br>\ud83c\udfae Fast-paced action.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Customize &amp; create.<br>\ud83c\udf0d Compete, share, and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to fly... or die?</p>",
    "short_description": "Fly, dodge, and survive in Fly to Death!, a fast-paced free arcade game. Beat levels or chase high scores in endless mode. Unlock new characters, customize them with cool gear, and build your own levels to share!",
